<title>GERMANY: R Stahl shares to be listed at 35 marks.</title>
<headline>R Stahl shares to be listed at 35 marks.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Germany's R. Stahl AG will be issued to subscribers to the company's initial public offering at a price of 35 marks, arranger Dresdner Bank said on Friday.</p>
<p>This is at the upper end of the bookbuilding range of 30 marks to 35 marks.</p>
<p>Dresdner said the issue was more than 45 times oversubscribed.</p>
<p>The strong demand came from both private and institutional investors in Germany and the rest of Europe.</p>
<p>The shares will list on the bourse on Monday.</p>
<p>--Clifford Coonan, Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
